; Hardware IRQ entry (hw_irq_vector at $FFFE). Saves A, X and Y, then jumps through irq_vector to the raster
; handler of the current screen. The test of the stacked status register uses AND #$00, so the BRK branch
; to JMP (io1_dummy) is never taken. Every handler ends with PLA/TAY/PLA/TAX/PLA/RTI.
; Handlers: irq_player_screen; irq_title_frame and irq_title_split (title and game over); irq_game_bottom,
; irq_game_playfield and irq_game_colour_split (game screen).
